{"url": "https://wiki.idlecorp.xyz/api.php?format=json&formatversion=2&action=parse&page=CPU+factory&prop=text%7Clinks%7Cimages%7Ctemplates%7Ccategories&redirects=1", "retrievedAt": "2026-10-09T14:55:19.267457+00:00", "body": "{\"parse\":{\"title\":\"CPU factory\",\"pageid\":25,\"redirects\":[],\"text\":\"<div class=\\\"mw-parser-output\\\"><table class=\\\"wikitable\\\" style=\\\"float:right;max-width: 35%;\\\">\\n<caption><small><a href=\\\"/index.php/Legend\\\" title=\\\"Legend\\\">Need help with the table?</a></small>\\n</caption>\\n<tbody><tr>\\n<th colspan=\\\"2\\\"><a href=\\\"/index.php/Help:IdleCorp_Profit#Cost\\\" title=\\\"Help:IdleCorp Profit\\\">Cost</a>\\n</th></tr>\\n<tr>\\n<td><b><a href=\\\"/index.php/Help:IdleCorp_Profit#Cost_2\\\" title=\\\"Help:IdleCorp Profit\\\">Cost</a></b></td>\\n<td>$15,000, 10,000x <a href=\\\"/index.php/Aluminum\\\" title=\\\"Aluminum\\\">aluminum</a>,<br /> 1,000x <a href=\\\"/index.php/Glass\\\" title=\\\"Glass\\\">glass</a>, 100,000x <a href=\\\"/index.php/Wood\\\" title=\\\"Wood\\\">wood</a>\\n</td></tr>\\n<tr>\\n<td><b><a href=\\\"/index.php/Help:IdleCorp_Profit#Total_Cost\\\" title=\\\"Help:IdleCorp Profit\\\">Total Cost</a></b></td>\\n<td>$100,000\\n</td></tr>\\n<tr>\\n<th colspan=\\\"2\\\"><a href=\\\"/index.php/Help:IdleCorp_Profit#Production\\\" title=\\\"Help:IdleCorp Profit\\\">Production</a>\\n</th></tr>\\n<tr>\\n<td><b><a href=\\\"/index.php/Help:IdleCorp_Profit#Consumes_.28Inputs.29\\\" title=\\\"Help:IdleCorp Profit\\\">Inputs</a></b></td>\\n<td>8x <a href=\\\"/index.php/Silicon\\\" title=\\\"Silicon\\\">silicon</a>, 1x <a href=\\\"/index.php/Gold\\\" title=\\\"Gold\\\">gold</a>\\n</td></tr>\\n<tr>\\n<td><b><a href=\\\"/index.php/Help:IdleCorp_Profit#Produces_.28Outputs.29\\\" title=\\\"Help:IdleCorp Profit\\\">Outputs</a></b></td>\\n<td>5x <a href=\\\"/index.php/CPU\\\" title=\\\"CPU\\\">CPU</a>\\n</td></tr>\\n<tr>\\n<td><b><a href=\\\"/index.php/Help:IdleCorp_Profit#Production_interval\\\" title=\\\"Help:IdleCorp Profit\\\">Production interval</a></b></td>\\n<td>2 minutes\\n</td></tr>\\n<tr>\\n<td><b><a href=\\\"/index.php/Help:IdleCorp_Profit#Production.2FMin\\\" title=\\\"Help:IdleCorp Profit\\\">Production/Min</a></b></td>\\n<td>150x <a href=\\\"/index.php/CPU\\\" title=\\\"CPU\\\">CPU</a>\\n</td></tr>\\n<tr>\\n<th colspan=\\\"2\\\"><a href=\\\"/index.php/Help:IdleCorp_Profit#Profit\\\" title=\\\"Help:IdleCorp Profit\\\">Profit</a>\\n</th></tr>\\n<tr>\\n<td><b><a href=\\\"/index.php/Help:IdleCorp_Profit#Profit_per\\\" title=\\\"Help:IdleCorp Profit\\\">Profit/Min</a></b></td>\\n<td>$500.00\\n</td></tr>\\n<tr>\\n<td><b><a href=\\\"/index.php/Help:IdleCorp_Profit#Profit_per\\\" title=\\\"Help:IdleCorp Profit\\\">Profit/Hour</a></b></td>\\n<td>$30,000.00\\n</td></tr>\\n<tr>\\n<td><b><a href=\\\"/index.php/Help:IdleCorp_Profit#Return_On_Investment\\\" title=\\\"Help:IdleCorp Profit\\\">Return On Investment</a></b></td>\\n<td>0.37%\\n</td></tr>\\n<tr>\\n<th colspan=\\\"2\\\">Aliases\\n</th></tr>\\n<tr>\\n<td colspan=\\\"2\\\">cpu factory, cpufactory, cpu fac\\n</td></tr></tbody></table>\\n<p>The CPU factory is a facility that produces 5x <a href=\\\"/index.php/CPU\\\" title=\\\"CPU\\\">CPU</a> every 2 minutes. \\n</p><p>Sustaining it requires use of 10/~34 <a href=\\\"/index.php/Silicon_mine\\\" title=\\\"Silicon mine\\\">Silicon mines</a> and 5/8 of a <a href=\\\"/index.php/Gold_mine\\\" title=\\\"Gold mine\\\">Gold mine</a>.\\n</p><p>This gives a ratio of 10 CPU Factories for every 34 silicon mines and 16 gold mines.\\n</p>\\n<h2><span class=\\\"mw-headline\\\" id=\\\"Related_facilities\\\">Related facilities</span><span class=\\\"mw-editsection\\\"><span class=\\\"mw-editsection-bracket\\\">[</span><a href=\\\"/index.php?title=CPU_factory&amp;action=edit&amp;section=1\\\" title=\\\"Edit section: Related facilities\\\">edit</a><span class=\\\"mw-editsection-bracket\\\">]</span></span></h2>\\n<p><b>As construction material</b>\\n</p>\\n<ul><li><a href=\\\"/index.php/